+**A Gym caveat found while doing this, since fixed.** Directory order
+mattered. With the live directory read *first*, `fin-saccr-rwa-1790406697`
+came from the live copy, which didn't carry the retained manifest's *mixed*
+mark. The claim then counted that directory's pass: 4 of 10, up to $0.0835.
+With the retained directories first, as above, the mark held and the
+directory was left out. The Gym now prefers the retained copy and applies a
+manifest's marks to every copy of a run, so either order prints the counts
+above.
 
